jclaw is an independent reimplementation of the architecture of IronClaw
(https://github.com/nearai/ironclaw). No IronClaw source is included or
derived from; the correspondence is one of design, and the layering, the
turn/run lifecycle, and the capability model are credited to that project.

The uber jar and the native image bundle third-party dependencies. Those
carry their own licenses and their own notices, which apply to them and not
to the terms above; the licenses are declared in each dependency's own
metadata and are not restated here, because a hand-copied list goes stale on
the first version bump.
